{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/cdaecf0d401232787ae8d3a0c1aa70f2.webp?t=1767063372\" width=615 height=39 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/b13c6c195878004c0acefa0566e0c495.poster.avif?t=1767063372\" width=614 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/b13c6c195878004c0acefa0566e0c495.webm?t=1767063372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/b13c6c195878004c0acefa0566e0c495.mp4?t=1767063372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The powerful rendering capabilities of Unreal Engine 5 create an extremely realistic and exquisite game world for players. Whether it's the bustling streets of the city, the buildings full of life, or the swaying flowers and trees, everything is presented with\u7ec6\u817b\u7684\u753b\u8d28 (detailed graphics), delivering an immersive visual experience.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/32f666c947e2d226a749ea1e6f66dd7e.webp?t=1767063372\" width=615 height=39 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/c3742f3c02cf2f2af1d92375a1034f14.poster.avif?t=1767063372\" width=614 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/c3742f3c02cf2f2af1d92375a1034f14.webm?t=1767063372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/c3742f3c02cf2f2af1d92375a1034f14.mp4?t=1767063372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>As a third-person open-world game, &quot;Nice City&quot; offers players great freedom. Players can roam the city at will, freely choosing paths and methods of exploration. You can stroll through bustling commercial districts to experience the lively urban atmosphere, or delve into quiet alleyways to discover hidden secrets. A rich variety of scenes and locations await discovery, and every exploration might bring unexpected surprises.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/15c6351e18e2931e94c5cc4a36ed0b6f.webp?t=1767063372\" width=615 height=39 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/3cbc07b69baef33a46768a32a66f3a35.poster.avif?t=1767063372\" width=614 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/3cbc07b69baef33a46768a32a66f3a35.webm?t=1767063372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/extras/3cbc07b69baef33a46768a32a66f3a35.mp4?t=1767063372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>When facing various challenges, players will use a wide array of weapons for intense shooting combat. The game's shooting feel is smooth, the controls are precise, and different weapons have unique characteristics and attack styles. Players can flexibly choose based on the actual combat situation to formulate personalized combat strategies. From pistols and rifles to rocket launchers, every shot delivers satisfying impact, immersing players in a tense and exciting combat atmosphere.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028160?t=17670633