/extras/3cbc07b69baef33a46768a32a66f3a35.mp4?t=1767063372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>When facing various challenges, players will use a wide array of weapons for intense shooting combat. The game's shooting feel is smooth, the controls are precise, and different weapons have unique characteristics and attack styles. Players can flexibly choose based on the actual combat situation to formulate personalized combat strategies. From pistols and rifles to rocket launchers, every shot delivers satisfying impact, immersing players in a tense and exciting combat atmosphere.</strong>","developers":["\u8042\u5b87\u661f"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028160/13646fc14e1f6da1ba52aceddc10dd69c8d24e13/header.jpg?t=1767063372","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028160/990387322/8afd09f3a88ece30164e52fb82cb66675426b9b1/1760174216/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760174821","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028160/990387322/8afd09f3a88ece30164e52fb82cb66675426b9b1/1760174216/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760174821","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028160/990387322/8afd09f3a88ece30164e52fb82cb66675426b9b1/1760174216/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760174821","id":257215997,"name":"pv","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215997/0e6c5eb6e29a7da5ca0c7ef50097e52f003d50bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760174821"}],"name":"Nice City","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3470 @ 3.2GHZ (4 \u4e2a CPU) / AMD X8 FX-8350 @ 4GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1060 6gb/Rx 580<b